#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:12
msgid ""
"The stage gates preserve source/override precedence, typed provenance, "
"registry revision identity and exact profile/period authority. An edit "
"baseline is short-lived and value-free; active execution supports "
"scalar/binding edits while refusing row intents. M123 with captured "
"withholding refuses calculation through export pending a settled count "
"rule; M193 prior-accrual settlement has a later filing/export refusal. "
"M036 records and operator observations are local assertions; M145 is a "
"payer communication, with filing/submission links explicitly refused. "
"Report PDF signatures are pinned to a profile key only when store "
"verification succeeds, and expressly do not claim AEAT status. Edit "
"admission (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/edit_admission.py`) M123 gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m123_count_authority_gate.py`) M145 "
"ownership (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`) Report"
" verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_report_verification.py`) "
