#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:36
msgid ""
"Local export replays the sealed revision into an approved filing draft, "
"rebuilds model producer facts and applies schema, profile, ledger, cross-"
"period and special-model gates before selecting the official layout. It "
"stages a BOE artifact beside the chosen destination, appends an export "
"event, publishes bytes and verifies the landed size/digest. A publication"
" failure after the event could leave history for a file that never "
"appeared; this is a sequencing risk to test. Calculation-report CSV/PDF "
"is a different local artifact: the canonical report carries provenance "
"and its PDF can receive a domain-separated Ed25519 signature with "
"`aeat_official=false`. Document-only validation yields `valid_unpinned`; "
"profile-store verification pins the key and rebuilds the report. Neither "
"artifact is AEAT acceptance. Spreadsheet export/pull/verify is another "
"supervised surface and remote parity work can modify Google Sheets; the "
"workbook plan and registered effect accounting do not make it an official"
" filing. Modelo export (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`) "
"Export sink (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export_sink.py`) Report "
"signature "
