#: ../../technical/topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md:38
msgid ""
"Local filing requires the exact verification report and rechecks "
"readiness and evidence. It persists a PRESENTADO revision with a filing "
"record whose AEAT status is PENDIENTE, co-writing pointers, "
"participation, events and app-filing observations. Such local "
"observations can inform future calculations but remain nonofficial for "
"dependent filing gates. External import instead needs registry-grounded "
"values and receipt/register evidence matching model, period and taxpayer;"
" reconciliation promotes a pending chain only on comparable matching "
"evidence, otherwise records discrepancy or unverifiable status. An "
"amendment starts only from a current AEAT-confirmed, externally evidenced"
" filing baseline, creates a new local pending correction and still "
"requires external confirmation later. Local filing transition "
